; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.35 on BTCUSD - trailing result M5 + Candles trailing, setup 3 of 3: both, session 0700-1200 server time, trend filter M15 EMA 100, target 2R. DO NOT LOAD ON GOLD.
; Trailing: stop beyond the low / high of the last 5 closed M5 candles, once the profit reaches 0.5R. Needs EA v1.35 or later (TrailMode 6, TrailParam 5).
; Picked on Jan 2025 - May 15 2026 only (score 1.31): 120 trades, PF 1.49.
; UNSEEN May 16 - Nov 13 2026: this setup 43 trades, PF 2.51, net +16.9R; the 3 setups of this combination together 156 trades, PF 1.89 (stressed 1.71).
; EARLIER DATA, before the calibration period: 2024: this setup 108 trades, PF 1.25; 2023: this setup 112 trades, PF 0.85. The combination together: 2024 PF 1.02 (306 trades); 2023 PF 0.92 (320 trades). The 2026 result did NOT hold on earlier data: UNPROVEN, demo and Strategy Tester only.
; Data: Binance BTCUSDT M1 in broker server time, assumed spread 10 USD. Points are 0.01 USD: 2000 points = 20 USD.
; Times are BROKER SERVER TIME (New York + 7 h: GMT+2 in the US winter, GMT+3 in the US summer).
; UseNewsFilter was not in the backtest.
